@startuml System-Communication

title System Component Communication (Based on Actual Implementation)

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor<<service>> WhiteSmoke
  BorderColor<<service>> Black
  BorderThickness 2
  FontSize 13
  Padding 20
}

skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  BorderThickness 1
  FontSize 11
}

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 100
skinparam ranksep 60

' ============================================================================
' COMPONENTS (Based on actual codebase)
' ============================================================================

rectangle "**External Service**\n<size:11>//React/Vite Frontend//</size>\n<size:10>OrderForm Component</size>" as ExternalService <<service>>

rectangle "**API Gateway**\n<size:11>//Spring Cloud Gateway//</size>\n<size:10>Port: 8080</size>" as APIGateway <<service>>

rectangle "**Orchestrator**\n<size:11>//Spring Boot Service//</size>\n<size:10>OrderIngestController</size>" as Orchestrator <<service>>

' ============================================================================
' INTERFACES (Based on actual API endpoints and communication)
' ============================================================================

interface "IOrderAPI\nPOST /api/v1/orchestrator/orders\nGET /api/v1/orchestrator/orders/:id" as IOrderAPI

interface "ICircuitBreaker\nfallbackUri: /fallback/orchestrator" as ICircuitBreaker

interface "ICorsPolicy\nAllowedOrigins: localhost:5173" as ICorsPolicy

' ============================================================================
' CONNECTIONS
' ============================================================================

' External Service -> API Gateway
ExternalService --( IOrderAPI : requires
ExternalService --( ICorsPolicy : requires

' API Gateway provides CORS and routes
APIGateway -0- ICorsPolicy : provides
APIGateway -0- ICircuitBreaker : provides

' API Gateway -> Orchestrator
APIGateway --( IOrderAPI : routes to

' Orchestrator provides Order API
Orchestrator -0- IOrderAPI : provides

' ============================================================================
' ACTUAL DATA FLOW (from codebase)
' ============================================================================

note right of ExternalService
  **Request Payload:**
  {
    "title": string,
    "author": string,
    "pages": number,
    "coverType": "SOFTCOVER|HARDCOVER",
    "pageType": "GLOSSY|MATTE",
    "quantity": number
  }

  **Endpoint:**
  POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orchestrator/orders
end note

note top of APIGateway
  **Gateway Configuration:**
  • Routes: /api/v1/orchestrator/** → orchestrator:8082
  • Circuit Breaker: orchestratorCircuitBreaker
  • Fallback: /fallback/orchestrator (503)
  • Filters: Logging, CORS, CircuitBreaker
  • Redis: Rate limiting (disabled)

  **Resilience4j Settings:**
  • Sliding Window: 50 calls
  • Failure Threshold: 50%
  • Wait Duration: 10s
end note

note right of Orchestrator
  **Response:**
  {
    "orderId": long,
    "title": string,
    "author": string,
    "status": "PENDING|PROCESSING|...",
    "createdAt": timestamp
  }

  **Endpoints:**
  • POST /api/v1/orchestrator/orders → Create
  • GET /api/v1/orchestrator/orders/:id → Read
end note

' ============================================================================
' LAYOUT
' ============================================================================

ExternalService -[hidden]right-> APIGateway
APIGateway -[hidden]right-> Orchestrator

' ============================================================================
' LEGEND
' ============================================================================

legend bottom left
  **Actual Communication Flow:**
  1. User submits order form (React)
  2. fetch() → localhost:8080/api/v1/orchestrator/orders
  3. API Gateway routes to orchestrator:8082
  4. Circuit Breaker monitors health
  5. Orchestrator processes & returns OrderResponse

  **Interface Notation:**
  -0- = Provides interface
  --( = Requires interface

  **Technologies:**
  • Frontend: React 18 + Vite + TypeScript
  • Gateway: Spring Cloud Gateway 3.2.0
  • Backend: Spring Boot 3.2.0
end legend

@enduml
